  "question": {
    "text": "A <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math> block&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> rests as shown on a bracket&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> of the same mass. Constant forces <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math> start to act at a time <math><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> when the distance of block&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> from the pulley is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>. Time (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>) when block&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> reaches the pulley is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math>. Find the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mi>t</mi></math>.<br />\r<br />\r<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/cgekcmkozhkldkxlvngqsjtsdiltubnayjqcsvbtxlbmaiouql.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "First, find out the acceleration of A so for this<br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />Now use pseudo concept (in which&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> is the non-inertial frame)<br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/eplenwwzxlxoiyhcxghhytdzaqhqvwlaqkgjlfssvzgbgbakal.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" /><br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/zcmsppcpenawhqqxupytdiybctrukrefgqadoxelshtcbvdrxk.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" /><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />Now <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>10</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>",
